            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nor for your sake do I ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", saith the Lord Jehovah, be it known unto you: be ashamed and confounded for your ways, O house of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the Lord Jehovah: In the day that I cleanse you from all your iniquities, I will cause the cities to be inhabited, and the waste places shall be builded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the land that was desolate shall be tilled, whereas it was a desolation in the sight of all that passed by. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall say, This land that was desolate is become like the garden of Eden; and the waste and desolate and ruined cities are fortified and inhabited. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the nations that are left round about you shall know that I, Jehovah, have builded the ruined places, and planted that which was desolate: I, Jehovah, have spoken it, and I will do it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
